 ],
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "I was born from a rock.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.667,
   "w0": 0,
   "w1": 5
  },
  {
   "text": "Literally.",
   "start": 2.03,
   "end": 2.512,
   "w0": 6,
   "w1": 6
  },
  {
   "text": "And three hundred years later,",
   "start": 2.903,
   "end": 4.245,
   "w0": 7,
   "w1": 11
  },
  {
   "text": "I beat up heaven.",
   "start": 4.512,
   "end": 5.618,
   "w0": 12,
   "w1": 15
  },
  {
   "text": "But let me start at the beginning.",
   "start": 6.112,
   "end": 7.566,
   "w0": 16,
   "w1": 22
  },
  {
   "text": "On top of Flower Fruit Mountain sat a magic stone.",
   "start": 8.125,
   "end": 11.243,
   "w0": 23,
   "w1": 32
  },
  {
   "text": "One day...",
   "start": 11.661,
   "end": 12.15,
   "w0": 33,
   "w1": 34
  },
  {
   "text": "it cracked open.",
   "start": 12.452,
   "end": 13.299,
   "w0": 35,
   "w1": 37
  },
  {
   "text": "And out popped me.",
   "start": 13.7,
   "end": 14.569,
   "w0": 38,
   "w1": 41
  },
  {
   "text": "A monkey.",
   "start": 15.003,
   "end": 15.472,
   "w0": 42,
   "w1": 43
  },
  {
   "text": "Made of stone.",
   "start": 15.871,
   "end": 16.699,
   "w0": 44,
   "w1": 46
  },
  {
   "text": "When I opened my eyes,",
   "start": 17.151,
   "end": 18.275,
   "w0": 47,
   "w1": 51
  },
  {
   "text": "two beams of light shot into the sky.",
   "start": 18.505,
   "end": 20.729,
   "w0": 52,
   "w1": 59
  },
  {
   "text": "So bright,",
   "start": 21.097,
   "end": 21.762,
   "w0": 60,
   "w1": 61
  },
  {
   "text": "the Jade Emperor,",
   "start": 21.937,
   "end": 22.953,
   "w0": 62,
   "w1": 64
  },
  {
   "text": "the ruler of heaven,",
   "start": 22.953,
   "end": 24.171,
   "w0": 65,
   "w1": 68
  },
  {
   "text": "spilled his tea.",
   "start": 24.171,
   "end": 24.984,
   "w0": 69,
   "w1": 71
  },
  {
   "text": "He looked down and said:",
   "start": 25.369,
   "end": 27.238,
   "w0": 72,
   "w1": 76
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Eh.",
   "start": 27.558,
   "end": 27.785,
   "w0": 77,
   "w1": 77
  },
  {
   "text": "It's just a monkey.\"",
   "start": 28.112,
   "end": 28.954,
   "w0": 78,
   "w1": 81
  },
  {
   "text": "Big mistake.",
   "start": 29.457,
   "end": 30.381,
   "w0": 82,
   "w1": 83
  },
  {
   "text": "The other monkeys found a giant waterfall and made a deal:",
   "start": 30.731,
   "end": 33.456,
   "w0": 84,
   "w1": 94
  },
  {
   "text": "whoever jumps through it...",
   "start": 33.896,
   "end": 34.895,
   "w0": 95,
   "w1": 98
  },
  {
   "text": "becomes king.",
   "start": 35.186,
   "end": 36.011,
   "w0": 99,
   "w1": 100
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone was scared.",
   "start": 36.437,
   "end": 37.972,
   "w0": 101,
   "w1": 103
  },
  {
   "text": "So I jumped.",
   "start": 38.34,
   "end": 39.334,
   "w0": 104,
   "w1": 106
  },
  {
   "text": "Behind the water was a secret cave.",
   "start": 39.697,
   "end": 41.641,
   "w0": 107,
   "w1": 113
  },
  {
   "text": "Stone beds,",
   "start": 41.979,
   "end": 42.663,
   "w0": 114,
   "w1": 115
  },
  {
   "text": "stone bowls,",
   "start": 42.663,
   "end": 43.347,
   "w0": 116,
   "w1": 117
  },
  {
   "text": "stone everything.",
   "start": 43.347,
   "end": 45.056,
   "w0": 118,
   "w1": 119
  },
  {
   "text": "And just like that...",
   "start": 45.464,
   "end": 46.451,
   "w0": 120,
   "w1": 123
  },
  {
   "text": "I was the Monkey King.",
   "start": 46.767,
   "end": 48.276,
   "w0": 124,
   "w1": 128
  },
  {
   "text": "We partied for three hundred years.",
   "start": 48.689,
   "end": 50.632,
   "w0": 129,
   "w1": 134
  },
  {
   "text": "Peaches,",
   "start": 50.929,
   "end": 51.433,
   "w0": 135,
   "w1": 135
  },
  {
   "text": "games,",
   "start": 51.433,
   "end": 51.938,
   "w0": 136,
   "w1": 136
  },
  {
   "text": "zero homework.",
   "start": 51.938,
   "end": 53.199,
   "w0": 137,
   "w1": 138
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I noticed my oldest friend getting really,",
   "start": 53.725,
   "end": 56.661,
   "w0": 139,
   "w1": 146
  },
  {
   "text": "really old.",
   "start": 56.661,
   "end": 57.338,
   "w0": 147,
   "w1": 148
  },
  {
   "text": "And I learned the scariest word in the world:",
   "start": 57.806,
   "end": 59.945,
   "w0": 149,
   "w1": 157
  },
  {
   "text": "death.",
   "start": 60.568,
   "end": 60.941,
   "w0": 158,
   "w1": 158
  },
  {
   "text": "So I made a promise.",
   "start": 61.495,
   "end": 62.651,
   "w0": 159,
   "w1": 163
  },
  {
   "text": "I would never die.",
   "start": 62.912,
   "end": 64.126,
   "w0": 164,
   "w1": 167
  },
  {
   "text": "I built a raft and sailed for ten years to find a master who knew the secret of living forever.",
   "start": 64.516,
   "end": 69.418,
   "w0": 168,
   "w1": 187
  },
  {
   "text": "I found him on a misty mountain.",
   "start": 69.823,
   "end": 71.352,
   "w0": 188,
   "w1": 194
  },
  {
   "text": "Master Subodhi.",
   "start": 71.643,
   "end": 72.715,
   "w0": 195,
   "w1": 196
  },
  {
   "text": "He named me Sun Wukong.",
   "start": 73.068,
   "end": 74.683,
   "w0": 197,
   "w1": 201
  },
  {
   "text": "It means \"the monkey who understands emptiness.\"",
   "start": 75.015,
   "end": 77.724,
   "w0": 202,
   "w1": 208
  },
  {
   "text": "I still don't understand it.",
   "start": 78.286,
   "end": 79.41,
   "w0": 209,
   "w1": 213
  },
  {
   "text": "One night,",
   "start": 79.978,
   "end": 80.467,
   "w0": 214,
   "w1": 215
  },
  {
   "text": "he taught me his biggest secrets.",
   "start": 80.699,
   "end": 82.504,
   "w0": 216,
   "w1": 221
  },
  {
   "text": "Seventy-two transformations...",
   "start": 82.901,
   "end": 84.586,
   "w0": 222,
   "w1": 223
  },
  {
   "text": "and the cloud somersault.",
   "start": 84.886,
   "end": 86.068,
   "w0": 224,
   "w1": 227
  },
  {
   "text": "One flip,",
   "start": 86.423,
   "end": 86.844,
   "w0": 228,
   "w1": 229
  },
  {
   "text": "and I could fly farther than around the whole world.",
   "start": 86.844,
   "end": 89.581,
   "w0": 230,
   "w1": 239
  },
  {
   "text": "So of course,",
   "start": 89.95,
   "end": 90.708,
   "w0": 240,
   "w1": 242
  },
  {
   "text": "I showed off.",
   "start": 90.708,
   "end": 91.718,
   "w0": 243,
   "w1": 245
  },
  {
   "text": "I turned into a pine tree in front of everyone.",
   "start": 92.046,
   "end": 94.278,
   "w0": 246,
   "w1": 255
  },
  {
   "text": "Master was furious.",
   "start": 94.629,
   "end": 95.865,
   "w0": 256,
   "w1": 258
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Leave!",
   "start": 95.865,
   "end": 96.112,
   "w0": 259,
   "w1": 259
  },
  {
   "text": "And never tell anyone I was your teacher!\"",
   "start": 96.39,
   "end": 99.046,
   "w0": 260,
   "w1": 267
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he said one more thing.",
   "start": 99.501,
   "end": 101.163,
   "w0": 268,
   "w1": 273
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Your pride will trap you under a mountain one day.\"",
   "start": 101.636,
   "end": 104.261,
   "w0": 274,
   "w1": 283
  },
  {
   "text": "I laughed.",
   "start": 104.738,
   "end": 105.123,
   "w0": 284,
   "w1": 285
  },
  {
   "text": "And flew home in one somersault.",
   "start": 105.298,
   "end": 106.104,
   "w0": 286,
   "w1": 291
  },
  {
   "text": "But when I landed...",
   "start": 106.361,
   "end": 108.123,
   "w0": 292,
   "w1": 295
  },
  {
   "text": "my mountain was empty.",
   "start": 108.618,
   "end": 109.452,
   "w0": 296,
   "w1": 299
  },
  {
   "text": "Every single monkey...",
   "start": 109.82,
   "end": 110.877,
   "w0": 300,
   "w1": 302
  },
  {
   "text": "was gone.",
   "start": 111.297,
   "end": 111.915,
   "w0": 303,
   "w1": 304
  },
  {
   "text": "Part two.",
   "start": 111.915,
   "end": 112.533,
   "w0": 305,
   "w1": 306
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow so you don't miss it.",
   "start": 112.901,
   "end": 113.426,
   "w0": 307,
   "w1": 312
  }
 ]
}